## Deposit reviews before a release

Every returned booking with a deposit is reviewed twice before any of the deposit is released: Fleet signs fuel, kilometres, damage, late return, cleaning, tickets and highway tolls against the pickup photos, then Finance double-checks each, checks the toll operator and every ticket place. **Money** > **Payments** > **Deposit reviews** lists them; each booking has a **Deposit review** card. You may sign either side. To release a deposit before the review is done, use the settlement on the booking''s **Money** with the reason; it is recorded.

**Settings** > **Program settings**: **Deposit review required** (on), **Deposit review sweep days** (mon,wed,fri), **Deposit review toll url**, and **Deposit review ticket places**: each place''s name and official lookup link, edited as a list. A place you add applies to the reviews made after the change. **Money** > **Payments** > **Countdowns** shows the time left on every deposit hold, deposit return and plan payment, soonest first.

The accident card of a booking with the plan sold with the rental shows the renter''s own policy number and the provider''s claim page (Program settings, accident plan claim url). When the number was not captured at purchase, enter it on the booking''s accident card with **Enter the plan policy number**.',
